# KriyZen environment template (P01.5)
# The current application foundation needs no credentials or external services.
# Next.js sets NODE_ENV automatically; leave it unset here.

# Optional local HTTP port (must be between 1 and 65535).
# PORT=3000

# No NEXT_PUBLIC_* variables are currently required.
# Never put secrets, tokens, or credentials in NEXT_PUBLIC_* variables.
